          204,
          80,
          200,
          955,
          325
        ]
      ],
      "en": "We have already encountered many of the ideas of duality (studying a function by studying how linear functionals act upon it) in the theory of distributions. These ideas are very powerful in the study of Banach spaces and Hilbert spaces as well.",
      "zh": "在分布理论中, 已经遇到许多对偶性的思想 (通过研究线性泛函如何作用于函数来研究该函数). 这些思想在 Banach 空间和 Hilbert 空间的研究中也十分有力.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "source_locations": [
        {
