    {
      "id": "operator-sequential-continuity-definition",
      "type": "definition",
      "regions": [
        [
          204,
          80,
          605,
          955,
          700
        ]
      ],
      "en": "We say that an operator $L:X\\to Y$ is \\textbf{continuous} at a point $x\\in X$ if, whenever $x_n\\in X$ is a sequence such that $x_n\\to x$, we have $L(x_n)\\to L(x)$.",
      "zh": "若每当 $x_n\\in X$ 为满足 $x_n\\to x$ 的序列时都有 $L(x_n)\\to L(x)$, 就说算子 $L:X\\to Y$ 在点 $x\\in X$ 处\\textbf{连续}.",
      "label": "def:operator-sequential-continuity",
      "render_role": "definition",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 204,
          "printed_page": 194,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            241.87770056854077,
            381.7677811550152,
            279.85849652558437
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-06-batch-15/operator-sequential-continuity-definition-204.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0204.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
        "math:operator-sequential-continuity-definition:001",
        "math:operator-sequential-continuity-definition:002",
        "math:operator-sequential-continuity-definition:003",
        "math:operator-sequential-continuity-definition:004",
        "math:operator-sequential-continuity-definition:005"
      ],
      "source_review": "agent-reviewed",
