    {
      "id": "linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma",
      "type": "lemma",
      "regions": [
        [
          204,
          80,
          790,
          955,
          935
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $L:X\\to Y$ be a linear mapping.\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item If $L$ is continuous at the origin, it is continuous at every $x\\in X$.\n\\item $L$ is continuous if and only if it is bounded.\n\\end{enumerate}",
      "zh": "设 $L:X\\to Y$ 为线性映射.\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 $L$ 在原点处连续, 则它在每个 $x\\in X$ 处连续.\n\\item $L$ 连续的充分必要条件是它有界.\n\\end{enumerate}",
      "label": "lem:linear-mapping-bounded-continuity-equivalence",
      "render_role": "lemma",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 204,
          "printed_page": 194,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            315.8403032217309,
            381.7677811550152,
            373.8109917877448
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-06-batch-15/linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma-204.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0204.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma:001",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma:002",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma:003",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-lemma:004"
      ],
      "source_review": "agent-reviewed",
      "confidence": "high",
      "cross_reference_integration": "pending full target availability"
    },
    {
      "id": "linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof",
      "type": "proof",
      "regions": [
        [
          204,
          80,
          945,
          955,
          1335
        ]
      ],
      "en": "To prove part 1 we assume that $L$ is continuous at the origin. Note that the linearity of the operator implies $L(0)=0$. Then for any $x\\in X$ and any sequence $x_n\\in X$ with $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_n=x$ we have\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:linear-map-continuity-at-origin-translation}\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}L(x_n)-L(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}L(x_n-x)=L(0)=0,\n\\end{equation}\nso $L$ is continuous at $x$.\n\nTo prove part 2 we note that the definition of boundedness implies continuity at zero. Thus, by part 1, boundedness implies continuity. On the other hand, suppose $L$ is not bounded. Then for every $n$ there exists $y_n$ such that $\\|Ly_n\\|>n^2\\|y_n\\|$. Note that $x_n:=y_n(n\\|y_n\\|)^{-1}\\to0$ but $\\|Lx_n\\|>n$. It follows that $L$ is not continuous at the origin. Thus, continuity implies boundedness.",
      "zh": "为证明第 1 部分, 假设 $L$ 在原点处连续. 注意, 算子的线性性意味着 $L(0)=0$. 那么对任意 $x\\in X$ 及任意满足 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_n=x$ 的序列 $x_n\\in X$, 有\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:linear-map-continuity-at-origin-translation}\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}L(x_n)-L(x)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}L(x_n-x)=L(0)=0,\n\\end{equation}\n因而 $L$ 在 $x$ 处连续.\n\n为证明第 2 部分, 注意有界性的定义意味着在零点处连续. 因而由第 1 部分, 有界性蕴含连续性. 另一方面, 假设 $L$ 不有界. 那么对每个 $n$, 存在 $y_n$, 使 $\\|Ly_n\\|>n^2\\|y_n\\|$. 注意 $x_n:=y_n(n\\|y_n\\|)^{-1}\\to0$, 但 $\\|Lx_n\\|>n$. 因此 $L$ 在原点处不连续. 从而连续性蕴含有界性.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "proof",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 204,
          "printed_page": 194,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            377.80897030953884,
            381.7677811550152,
            533.7301326595073
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-06-batch-15/linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof-204.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0204.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:001",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:002",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:003",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:004",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:005",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:006",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:007",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:008",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:009",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:010",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:011",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:012",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:013",
        "math:linear-mapping-bounded-continuous-proof:014",
