    {
      "id": "bounded-operator-space-proof-exercise-and-duality",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          205,
          80,
          425,
          955,
          550
        ]
      ],
      "en": "The proof is straightforward and is left as an exercise (Problem~\\ref{ex:bounded-operator-space-completeness}). Linear mappings, also called linear operators, will be studied more extensively in the next chapter. In this section, we are interested in the special case of linear mappings from a Banach space to its scalar field.",
      "zh": "证明是直接的, 留作习题 (Problem~\\ref{ex:bounded-operator-space-completeness}). 线性映射也称线性算子, 将在下一章中作更深入研究. 本节关注从 Banach 空间到其标量域的线性映射这一特殊情形.",
      "label": null,
