    {
      "id": "linear-functional-dual-space-definition",
      "type": "definition",
      "regions": [
        [
          205,
          80,
          560,
          955,
          680
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $X$ be a real (complex) Banach space. Then a \\textbf{linear functional} on $X$ is a bounded linear mapping from $X$ to $\\mathbb{R}$ ($\\mathbb{C}$). The space of all linear functionals on $X$ is called the \\textbf{dual space} of $X$ and is denoted by $X^*$.",
      "zh": "设 $X$ 为实 (复) Banach 空间. 那么 $X$ 上的\\textbf{线性泛函}是从 $X$ 到 $\\mathbb{R}$ ($\\mathbb{C}$) 的有界线性映射. $X$ 上所有线性泛函组成的空间称为 $X$ 的\\textbf{对偶空间}, 记为 $X^*$.",
      "label": "def:linear-functional-dual-space",
      "render_role": "definition",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 205,
          "printed_page": 195,
          "bbox": [
